1
00:00:00,368 --> 00:00:03,368
(Raj:)That's not him.

2
00:00:04,539 --> 00:00:06,919
(Penny:)Oh, I can't wait for
you to meet everyone.

3
00:00:06,925 --> 00:00:08,705
(Penny:)I told them all about you.

4
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:10,210
(Susan (Penny's mother):)Like what?

5
00:00:10,212 --> 00:00:11,542
(Susan (Penny's mother):)Do they know about your brother?

6
00:00:11,546 --> 00:00:15,466
(Penny:)Uh, not everything, just,
like, the jail and drugs part.

7
00:00:15,467 --> 00:00:17,517
(Susan:)Why would you do that?

8
00:00:17,519 --> 00:00:18,889
(Leonard:)What?
The world doesn't need

9
00:00:18,887 --> 00:00:20,217
(Susan:)to know our problems.

10
00:00:20,222 --> 00:00:21,222
(Penny:)Well, Mom, I'm sorry, but...

11
00:00:21,223 --> 00:00:23,943
(Wyatt (Penny's father):)Hey, look, they got
Walgreens here, too.

12
00:00:25,227 --> 00:00:28,107
(Susan:)You really think it's helpful
to change the subject, Wyatt?

13
00:00:28,113 --> 00:00:30,393
(Wyatt:)Just trying to make this
a happy trip, dear.

14
00:00:30,398 --> 00:00:32,228
Well, quit it!

15
00:00:34,369 --> 00:00:36,569
(Penny:)So, uh, Randall,
can't believe

16
00:00:36,571 --> 00:00:38,041
(Penny:)after all these years
you finally get to visit me

17
00:00:38,039 --> 00:00:39,369
(Penny:)in California.

18
00:00:39,374 --> 00:00:41,294
(Randall (Penny's brother):)Well, good thing I was
a nonviolent offender,

19
00:00:41,293 --> 00:00:43,323
(Randall (Penny's brother):)otherwise I couldn't
have left the state.

20
00:00:43,328 --> 00:00:47,248
(Penny:)All right,
that's enough jail talk.

21
00:00:47,249 --> 00:00:50,299
Penny knows where I was;
she sent me cigarettes.

22
00:00:50,302 --> 00:00:53,002
(Susan:)You sent
your brother cigarettes?

23
00:00:53,004 --> 00:00:54,754
(Wyatt:)He was cooking and selling
crystal meth, Susan,

24
00:00:54,756 --> 00:00:57,926
(Wyatt:)I think we can
let the cigarettes slide.

